Package: ctrl-exec-common
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${perl:Depends},
 libjson-perl,
Description: mTLS remote script execution - shared library
 ctrl-exec runs scripts on remote agent hosts over HTTPS with mutual
 certificate authentication. Agents expose only an explicit allowlist of
 permitted scripts; there is no shell access.
 .
 This package contains the shared Exec:: Perl library used by both the
 ctrl-exec control host and the ctrl-exec-agent. It is not useful on its
 own - install ctrl-exec or ctrl-exec-agent.

Package: ctrl-exec-agent
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${perl:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ctrl-exec-common (= ${source:Version}),
 libio-socket-ssl-perl,
 openssl,
 adduser,
Description: mTLS remote script execution - agent
 ctrl-exec runs scripts on remote agent hosts over HTTPS with mutual
 certificate authentication. Agents expose only an explicit allowlist of
 permitted scripts; there is no shell access.
 .
 This package provides the agent (ctrl-exec-agent): an mTLS HTTPS server
 that executes only the scripts named in a per-host allowlist. Install it
 on each managed host, then pair it with a control host.

Package: ctrl-exec-dispatcher
Architecture: all
Provides: ctrl-exec
Replaces: ctrl-exec (<< 0.8.11~)
Conflicts: ctrl-exec (<< 0.8.11~)
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${perl:Depends},
 ctrl-exec-common (= ${source:Version}),
 libwww-perl,
 liblwp-protocol-https-perl,
 libio-socket-ssl-perl,
 openssl,
 adduser,
Description: mTLS remote script execution - dispatcher (control host)
 ctrl-exec runs scripts on remote agent hosts over HTTPS with mutual
 certificate authentication. Agents expose only an explicit allowlist of
 permitted scripts; there is no shell access.
 .
 This package provides the control host: the ctrl-exec-dispatcher CLI
 (manages the private CA, agent registry, pairing, and dispatch) and the
 ctrl-exec-api HTTP API server. Install it on the control host and install
 ctrl-exec-agent on each managed host.
